# A save made on a screen of 640x480 loaded on a wide one of 852x480
# (fixtures/wideload: snapshot's save abc and snapcfg's lba.cfg with
# WideScreen: ON, SaveAnywhere ON, recorded with -D 1920x1080). Load
# Game lists abc in the window, its picture the one snapshot showed, and
# it loads, grown out of its picture's place in the window to the whole
# screen.
hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot list
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 0.3
shot zoom
sleep 12
shot loaded
